  "claims": [
    "A checked deterministic suffix ending at a genuine native halt translates to the actual linked return jump at the same transition count; malformed fall-off is not accepted.",
    "The verdict materializer and physical head restoration form one actual block with 5*m+5 instructions and exact cost 3*m+4 transitions.",
    "The real optimized MAC caller reaches its fourth returned response in 251 transitions, with all terminal states still active, and its linked host preserves that prefix.",
    "The actual optimized caller, original comparison, return jumps, verdict materialization and head restoration run in one finite interactive code; source comparison has checked data-dependent time at most 35.",
    "The linked whole native run equals the original optimized 286-transition run mapped by an explicit full-frame transformation, including precise changed output tape and final code address.",
    "Whole native stopping bound is 290+3*m and code length is 257+5*m instructions. All oracle request/response transfers and executed handoff/head moves are included.",
    "The previous full MAC observation remains valid because the physical head returns to the original verdict. The original full outcome and physically written analysis bits have a joint correspondence to the guarded original mixed analysis.",
    "The linked code has certified stopping, exactly four new oracle queries, encoded transcript prefixes and actual three-bit request format at every supported awaiting state.",
    "For the same fixed eight-message/256-tag game, sampling the old key once yields the original full MAC law and success probability at most 1/256.",
    "Exact-footprint repair of a supplied higher comparison gives equal linked programs; the previous generated nonempty tensor/copy/discard comparison is instantiated."
  ],
  "concrete_contract": {
    "caller": "Previously certified optimized 252-instruction MAC caller.",
    "four_query_prefix_transitions": 251,
    "comparison_transition_upper_bound": 35,
    "analysis_restore_instructions": "5*m+5",
    "analysis_restore_exact_transitions": "3*m+4",
    "linked_instructions": "257+5*m",
    "linked_uniform_horizon": "290+3*m",
    "new_queries": 4,
    "output_tape_layout": "Original left and current cells; right = new bits mapped to Some ++ old right.drop(m). Input tape, private oracle state and transcript unchanged by suffix.",
    "two_output_example": {
      "instructions": 267,
      "uniform_transitions": 296,
      "verification": "Lean #guard_msgs checks (267, 296). General linked run/security theorems apply."
    }
  },
  "limits": [
    "The compiler handles the existing MAC analysis boxes with one sampled full-outcome seed; independent multiple-input and arbitrary probabilistic-box compilation are not proved.",
    "The right-side working tape region is intentionally overwritten, not silently preserved or reset. A later context needing old right-side data requires a separate ownership/preservation contract.",
    "The full linked code is for the optimized caller. No generic arbitrary-caller linker application or separate original-251-instruction linked-run theorem is asserted.",
    "The bound is uniform stopping, not equal elapsed time on every trace, timing-observer security, optimality or pointwise speed dominance.",
    "Oracle internals and initial key generation remain external. The new bound is not the total physical cryptosystem cost including those services.",
    "The full MAC observation and fixed success event are preserved. Giving extra packet data or elapsed times to a new adversary needs a separate security contract.",
    "Secret-state/transcript snapshots are proof representations, not native exports; only analysis verdict bits are physically materialized.",
    "Instruction counts exclude encoded source bytes, mask-generation costs, checking costs and total peak storage.",
    "Global finite local higher-basis completeness, old-library projection, remaining mixed overlaps, general contextual computational reductions/loss contracts and fair ordinary shared-proof total-cost comparison remain open."
  ],
